<title>USA: Rally's acquires assets from franchisee.</title>
<headline>Rally's acquires assets from franchisee.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rally's Hamburgers Inc on Wednesday said it acquired the assets of a 10-store franchisee based in Little Rock, Ark., for a total purchase price of $2.7 million, as part of a litigation settlement.</p>
<p>The cash disbursed in payment of the purchase price will be reduced by all amounts of royalties, advertising fees and interest owed to Rally's, the company said.</p>
<p>Rally's did not name the franchisee from which it acquired the assets.</p>
